# Changelog

## [0.3.1.19]

### Fixed
- improved re copying/importing in `PreProcessFitsIdi` and `FitsIdiToMS` data when previous run has made stale fits/ms.

### Added
- configuration parameter `force_reset` in `PreProcessFitsIdi` which will copy the fits file to the working directory.

